# PicoLearning

Offline-first AI learning (vanilla JS + IndexedDB). Sibling of PicoERP, PicoScan, PicoExpense.

Layers: UI → Services → Engines → Repository → IndexedDB. No IDB in UI.

- DB: `PicoLearning`
- OCR: PicoScan adapter only
- Models: configurable `js/data/modelRegistry.js` + WebLLM
- PDF only for now (no EPUB/DOCX)

Bump `APP_VERSION`, `index.html?v=`, `sw.js` `CACHE_VERSION` together.

Read README.md and DATA_MODEL.md before large changes.
